        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R-Series, Traditional Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA hook such as this is as useful in the kitchen as it is in the bathroom. A stylish way to hang a robe, towels, or even a lady's purse, it's a beautiful way to keep things off the floor in any room. This bathroom towel hook is made out of solid brass with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for. The R-Series Robe Hook features concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. Traditional in appearance, this robe peg is timeless, and since it is available in an array of popular finishes, you will be sure to find just the right look to suit your tastes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2009-specifications.gif?v=1704354580\" width=\"552\" height=\"272\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R-Series Single Robe Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R-Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R-Series Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2009.pdf?v=1704262290\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R-Series Single Robe Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
