                "title": "R-Series Single Robe Hook, Deltana R2009",
                "description": "Deltana R-Series Single Robe Hook - A hook such as this is as useful in the kitchen as it is in the bathroom. A stylish way to hang a robe, towels, or even a lady's purse, it's a beautiful way to keep things off the floor in any room. This bathroom towel hook is made out of solid brass with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for. The R-Series Robe Hook features concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. Traditional in appearance, this robe peg is timeless, and since it is available in 8 finishes, you will be sure to find just the right look to suit your tastes.",
